.TH GRID_HIT 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
grid_hit \- The visible item whose cell contains the screen point mx,my
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqgrid.h\(dq
.BI "int grid_hit(const Grid *g, float mx, float my);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
The visible item whose cell contains the screen point mx,my.
.SH RETURN VALUE
the item index, or \-1 when the point is on no cell (the gaps between cells count as no cell)
.SH MODULE
grid (src/engine/grid/grid.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR grid_handle_input (3),
.BR grid_window (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
